35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,Last year we barely saw each other. A shared house meant no privacy. I need balance.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I found that separate rooms cost nearly 8,000 yen more than a whole house. One bill is fairer.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The island houses have one bathroom and cold water. That sounds difficult for me.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The ferry takes two days. The train is ninety minutes. I strongly prefer the train.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,A whole house bill is much easier to manage. I hate the uncertainty of separate bookings.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
