43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,The city has trains every few minutes. The spa valley bus stops early.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,The city option seems flexible. But I worry about the cost of separate meals.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
