48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The train to the spa valley is quick. I can get there and back without losing a day.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,The all-in rate means I know the total cost. That is what I need.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I am leaning towards the spa town. It offers structure and space.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree. The inn arrangement seems the most harmonious for our group.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I am still concerned about the room, but the bath hours are good.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am happy with the spa town. The travel time is minimal.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,I am also leaning towards the spa town. The cost is clear and the travel is short.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
